---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="" title="PatternBreak | Decode Your Behavioral Blueprint">

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg text-center relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-saffron/20 text-brand-saffron-dark text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-6 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-saffron animate-pulse"></span>
        Behavioral Mapping · Pattern Diagnosis
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy leading-[1.1] mb-8 tracking-tight">
        Your life has a pattern. <br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-saffron to-brand-saffron-dark italic">You just can't see it yet.</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl text-brand-text max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10 font-medium">
        Find out exactly why you keep getting stuck — and get a personalized, actionable system to break free.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/get-reading" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:scale-105 hover:bg-brand-purple transition-transform shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
          Discover My Pattern
        </a>
        <a href="/how-it-works" class="font-semibold text-brand-navy hover:text-brand-saffron transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
          See the methodology
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 7.5h9M8 3.5l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE PAIN SECTION -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-white border-y border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Self Audit</div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Does this sound familiar?</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-text-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Mentally check the statements that resonate with your current reality.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-6">
        <!-- Checkbox items -->
        {[
          "I work hard but results never last.",
          "I overthink every decision until it's too late.",
          "I start strong but can't stay consistent.",
          "I give everything to others and have nothing left for me.",
          "I know what to do but can't make myself do it.",
          "I look fine outside but inside I'm exhausted.",
          "I feel stuck and don't know why.",
          "My relationships feel heavy even though I love my family.",
          "Money comes but never stays.",
          "I'm tired of the same cycle repeating year after year."
        ].map((pain) => (
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-brand-border cursor-pointer group">
            <div class="mt-1 flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded border-2 border-brand-border group-hover:border-brand-saffron flex items-center justify-center text-white group-hover:text-brand-saffron transition-colors">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-brand-navy font-medium text-lg">{pain}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 p-8 bg-brand-light-bg rounded-2xl border border-brand-border text-center">
        <p class="text-xl text-brand-navy font-medium leading-relaxed">
          If you checked even 3 of these — you're running a pattern. Not a personality flaw. Not bad luck. <span class="font-bold text-brand-saffron-dark italic">A PATTERN.</span><br/>And patterns can be identified, understood, and broken.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT YOU GET SECTION -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">The Output</div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-8">Your Personal Life Transformation Report</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-text mb-8">This isn't a document you read once. It's a manual you live by. We decode your operating system and give you the exact steps to rewire it.</p>
        
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            "Your behavioral operating system decoded",
            "The exact repeating loop keeping you stuck",
            "Your blind spots mapped with uncomfortable honesty",
            "What you must let go of — with specific daily practices",
            "Your karmic behavioral patterns — not mystical, practical",
            "React mode vs Create mode — where you are vs where you need to be",
            "Complete daily system designed for YOUR lifestyle",
            "Identity shift framework — old you vs new you",
            "10 hard-hitting truths to read every morning"
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-brand-navy font-medium">
              <span class="text-brand-saffron">✦</span>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a href="/get-reading" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-brand-saffron-dark hover:text-brand-navy transition-colors pb-1 border-b-2 border-brand-saffron-dark">
            Generate your manual
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 7.5h9M8 3.5l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 to-slate-200 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-white p-8 overflow-hidden relative">
           <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-brand-navy via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
           <div class="relative z-10 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 h-full flex flex-col">
             <div class="h-2 w-12 bg-brand-saffron rounded-full mb-6"></div>
             <div class="h-8 w-3/4 bg-slate-100 rounded mb-4"></div>
             <div class="h-4 w-full bg-slate-50 rounded mb-2"></div>
             <div class="h-4 w-5/6 bg-slate-50 rounded mb-8"></div>
             <div class="space-y-4 flex-grow">
               <div class="flex gap-4 items-center">
                 <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-saffron/20 shrink-0"></div>
                 <div class="flex-1 h-12 bg-slate-50 rounded"></div>
               </div>
               <div class="flex gap-4 items-center">
                 <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 shrink-0"></div>
                 <div class="flex-1 h-12 bg-slate-50 rounded"></div>
               </div>
               <div class="flex gap-4 items-center">
                 <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-saffron/20 shrink-0"></div>
                 <div class="flex-1 h-12 bg-slate-50 rounded"></div>
               </div>
             </div>
             <div class="mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
               <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 text-center font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Confidential Blueprint</div>
             </div>
           </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SOCIAL PROOF -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Real Shifts</div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-16">The impact of <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">seeing yourself</span></h2>
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <blockquote class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-brand-navy leading-relaxed mb-8">
          "I've read 100 astrology reports. This was the first one that made me cry — because it described exactly who I am, including the parts I hide. It gave me a system to finally break my 5-year career loop."
        </blockquote>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">K</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-brand-navy">Karthik S.</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted">Software Engineer</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
